.dev/search?q=name:CONS_Drug_Dreammist+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Effect\"> Effect </span></h3>\n<ul><li>When consumed, inflicts <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Mist_Apparitions_(Condition)\" title=\"Dream Mist Apparitions (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dream Mist Apparitions\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Mist_Apparitions_(Condition)\" title=\"Dream Mist Apparitions (Condition)\">Dream Mist Apparitions</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Dream_Mist_Apparitions\"> Condition: Dream Mist Apparitions </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Mist_Apparitions_(Condition)\" title=\"Dream Mist Apparitions (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dream Mist Apparitions\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/DRUG_Dream_Mist_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dream_Mist_Apparitions_(Condition)\" title=\"Dream Mist Apparitions (Condition)\">Dream Mist Apparitions</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 3  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;12)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;12)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>This creature is seeing myriad visions of a world beyond reckoning - or so they keep insisting.</li>\n<li>The affected entity is incapacitated.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div>    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Severn\" title=\"Severn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/25px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/38px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/50px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Severn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png/25px-Portrait_Severn.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Portrait_Severn.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Severn\" title=\"Severn\">Severn</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a></li>\n<li>On a barrel <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-1335&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-835</span> in the passageway from <a href=\"/wiki/Western_Beach\" title=\"Western Beach\">Western Beach</a>.</li>\n<li>In the wooden crate near <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Huido\" title=\"Huido\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/25px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/38px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/50px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Huido\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png/25px-Portrait_Huido.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/56/Portrait_Huido.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Huido\" title=\"Huido\">Huido</a> at the <a href=\"/wiki/Grey_Harbour_Docks\" title=\"Grey Harbour Docks\">Grey Harbour Docks</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-212&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-100</span></li>\n<li>In a pouch at the very top of the <a href=\"/wiki/Elfsong_Tavern\" title=\"Elfsong Tavern\">Elfsong Tavern</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;57&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-16</span></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202449\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.076 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2780/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42311/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8999/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1208257/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.209      1 Template:Misc_item_page\n100.00%   62.209      1 -total\n 48.57%   30.213     11 Template:Icon_text\n 42.75%   26.594     28 Template:Trim\n 19.06%   11.858      3 Template:Uid\n 16.97%   10.554      5 Template:Icon_link\n 14.33%    8.912      1 Template:Condition\n 10.38%    6.456      1 Template:Main_only\n 10.26%    6.385     11 Template:Ifempty\n 10.02%    6.235      3 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:11842-0